{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867760/extras/f807fa641cfedfa3b4329783eaf3b51d.avif?t=1753970768\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867760/extras/84791085f9801e63ddb25d7f5c7110e2.avif?t=1753970768\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Shell Bless the Faithless Demo</strong> is a free demo version of Shell Bless the Faithless,\u00a0 an action game that blends <i>3rd Person Shooter</i>\u00a0with roguelite elements. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867760/extras/f807fa641cfedfa3b4329783eaf3b51d.avif?t=1753970768\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867760/extras/25bd29819bbccb450956cce9af9be469.avif?t=1753970768\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867760/extras/f807fa641cfedfa3b4329783eaf3b51d.avif?t=1753970768\" data-has-big /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SHOTGUNS AND MYTH COLLIDE: AN EPIC BATTLE ACROSS THE NINE REALMS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become a Viking warrior who worships strength and devastating firepower.<strong> </strong>With divine blessings, fight the endless wave of enemies, and restore the broken dimensional gates with your allies to save the Nine Realms from the chaos caused by WHINER (Whispering Humans In Need of Everything).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867760/extras/665f64d730f2aa315a1d3883069bcc39.poster.avif?t=1753970768\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867760/extras/665f64d730f2aa315a1d3883069bcc39.webm?t=1753970768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867760/extras/665f64d730f2aa315a1d3883069bcc39.mp4?t=1753970768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>THRILLING SHOTGUN ACTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867760/extras/2a74ac54d6d26de936ce891eb03f2d0b.poster.avif?t=1753970768\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867760/extras/2a74ac54d6d26de936ce891eb03f2d0b.webm?t=1753970768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867760/extras/2a74ac54d6d26de936ce891eb03f2d0b.mp4?t=1753970768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feel your heart pound as you wield powerful shotguns action!  Explore dungeons, collect mysterious artifacts known as &quot;O-Parts,&quot; and experience a shotgun that transcends ordinary limits.\u00a0\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong> BLESSINGS OF THE GODS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867760/extras/c21d50423fb8dfd73872ff43d23b0341.poster.avif?t=1753970768\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867760/extras/c21d50423fb8dfd73872ff43d23b0341.webm?t=1753970768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867760/extras/c21d50423fb8dfd73872ff43d23b0341.mp4?t=1753970768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Select blessings from Norse gods such as Odin and Tyr, and harness their divine powers. Enhance your skills through the &quot;Path of Blessing&quot; to unlock diverse Oracles and Miracles, crafting your own unique combat style.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore dungeons, strenthen your shotgun and gears, and evolve inito a formidable warrior. Defeat the heretical foes and their leaders who threaten the Nine Realm!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EVER-CHANGING DUNGEONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867760/extras/a13f27137064a2e2fbe4dfb9f8acb936.poster.avif?t=1753970768\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867760/extras/a13f27137064a2e2fbe4dfb9f8acb936.webm?t=1753970768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867760/extras/a13f27137064a2e2fbe4dfb9f8acb936.mp4?t=1753970768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every battlefield bursts with action and unique encounters. Explore the Yggdrasil and Midgard dungeons within the Nine Realms to discover hidden gears and untold stories. Interact with various dungeon features such as Sanctuaries, Tablets of Legends, Echo Devices, Tribute Devices, and Shop.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each dungeon entrance offers a fresh and thrilling combat experience. With varied difficulties and both permanent and temporary upgrade systems, every player can enjoy challenge and fulfillment. Continuously grow through repeated gameplay, uncover special gear, and unravel hidden narratives. For those seeking the ultimate test, conquer the &quot;Ragnarok&quot; difficulty and prove your matery.\u00a0\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXPRESSIVE CHARACTER CUSTOMIZATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867760/extras/e79cd840662eaff0b384d0ceb545faa3.poster.avif?t=1753970768\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867760/extras/e79cd840662eaff0b384d0ceb545faa3.webm?t=1753970768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867760/extras/e79cd840662eaff0b384d0ceb545faa3.mp4?t=1753970768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After shaping your combat style through divine blessings, choose your armors, helmets, and cloaks to embody the true Norse warrior. Each O-Part collected adds impressive and distinctive shotgun attachments, further enhancing your personalized combat experience.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867760/extras/f807fa641cfedfa3b4329783eaf3b51d.avif?t=1753970768\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to dive into a chaotic world where legendary shotguns and Norse mythology collide? The warrior's journey to bless the heretics of the Nine Realms is about to begin!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867760/extras/b56eea5375f46ebb659e62dcb75defbb.poster.avif?t=1753970768\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867760/extras/b56eea5375f46ebb659e62dcb75defb